repository: "https://github.com/jiarong0423/unseen-bikes-dispatch"
url: "https://github.com/jiarong0423/unseen-bikes-dispatch"
abstract: "When a bike-share station is full, bikes end up outside the docks and official station data cannot see them. This proof of concept replays public data to estimate how a few off-peak trucks could pre-position bikes along forward routes inside 2 km circles, and how a Bluetooth temporary return could make the unseen bikes visible. Algorithmic replay, not operating results; no field deployment."
